      <text xml:space="preserve">{{Not verified}}
'''Galguduud''' is a region (''gobolka'') in central [[Somalia]]. Its capital is [[Dhusa Mareb]] while the largest city is [[Abudwak]]. It is bordered by [[Ethiopia]], the Somali regions of [[Mudug]], [[Hiiraan]] and [[Shabeellaha Dhexe]], and the [[Indian Ocean]].
The predominant [[clan]]s in the region are [[Marehan]] and [[Habr Gidr]].

The districts of Galguduud Region are:

* [[Abudwak]]--Marehan
* [[Dhusa Mareb]]-- Ayr (Habr Gidr)&amp; Marehan
* [[Dhabat]]--Saleban
* [[Balan-Bale]]--Marehan &amp; Ayr
* [[Cadado]]--Saleban (Habar Gidir)
* [[Guriceel]]--Ayr (Habr Gider)
* [[Herale]]--Fiqi Muxumud (Dir)
* [[Elbuur]]--Murusade &amp; Duduble


{{Somalia_Regions}}

{{AfricaE-geo-stub}}

[[de:Galguduud]]</text>
    </revision>
