      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Hiiraan''' is a region (''gobolka'') in central [[Somalia]]. Its capital is [[Beledweyne]]. It is bordered by [[Ethiopia]] and the Somali regions of [[Galguduud]], [[Shabeellaha Dhexe]], [[Shabeellaha Hoose]], [[Bay, Somalia|Bay]] and [[Bakool]].

{{Somalia_Regions}}

{{AfricaE-geo-stub}}

