        <ip>86.132.229.20</ip>
      </contributor>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Bakool''' is a region (''gobolka'') in central [[Somalia]]. Its capital is [[Xuddur]]. It is bordered by [[Ethiopia]] and the Somalian regions of [[Hiiraan]], [[Bay, Somalia|Bay]] and [[Gedo]]. It has an estimated population of 226,000.
Bakool like Gedo, Bay and most parts of Middle Juba (Jubbada Dhexe) regions used to be part of the old Upper Region which was subdivided in the mid 1980's by the then military regime. 
It consists of the following districts:

*Hudur (Xuddur)
*Tijeglow (Tiyeglow)
*Wajid
*Yed 
and the propsed districts of:
*Dollandole
*Rabdhure
 
{{Somalia_Regions}}

{{AfricaE-geo-stub}}

[[id:Bakool]]</text>
