  <page>
    <title>Shabeellaha Dhexe</title>
    <id>185138</id>
    <revision>
      <id>41267289</id>
      <timestamp>2006-02-26T04:28:58Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <ip>86.132.229.20</ip>
      </contributor>
      <text xml:space="preserve">[[Image:SomaliaShabeellahaDhexe.PNG|right|200px|]]

'''Shabeellaha Dhexe''', also '''Central Shabele''' is a region (''gobolka'') in southern [[Somalia]]. As part of the former Benadair region its capital was [[Mogadishu]] until in the mid 1980's, but now is '''[[Jawhar]]''', also spelled ''Giohar''. It is bordered by the Somalian regions of [[Galguduud]], [[Hiiraan]], [[Shabeellaha Hoose]] and [[Banaadir]] and the [[Indian Ocean]].  
Its current districts are:
*Jowhar (capital)
*Balad
*Adale (Cadale)
*Adan Yabaal
{{AfricaE-geo-stub}}
{{Somalia_Regions}}</text>
    </revision>
