  <page>
    <title>Safari</title>
    <id>185166</id>
    <revision>
      <id>33438707</id>
      <timestamp>2006-01-01T02:10:45Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>Mike Dillon</username>
        <id>368827</id>
      </contributor>
      <minor />
      <comment>-[[Category:Lists of English words from various languages]]</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Safari''' is an overland journey, especially a big game [[Hunting#Safari |hunting]] journey.  ''Safari'' may also refer to:

* [[SAFARI]], a proposed French government database of personal data
* [[Safari (beverage)]], an alcoholic cocktail
* [[Safari (web browser)]], for Apple Macintosh computers
* [[Safari jacket]], a type of clothing
* [[Pontiac Safari]] station wagon
* [[Tata Safari]], an SUV
* Safari, a model of [[Land Rover#Models |Land Rover]] four-wheel-drive vehicle
* Safari Bookshelf, an online service of [[O'Reilly Media#Online resources |O'Reilly Media]]
* Ski-Doo Safari, a model of [[snowmobile]] from [[Bombardier]]

{{disambig}}

