* ''[[The Bonny Black Hare (album)|The Bonny Black Hare]]'' ([[1967 in music|1967]])
* ''[[Landfall (album)|Landfall]]'' ([[1971 in music|1971]])
* ''[[Shearwater (album)|Shearwater]]'' ([[1972 in music|1972]])
* ''[[Sweet Wivelsfield (album)|Sweet Wivelsfield]]'' ([[1974 in music|1974]])
* ''[[Crown of Horn (album)|Crown of Horn]]'' ([[1976 in music|1976]])
* ''[[Kershaw Sessions (album)|Kershaw Sessions]]'' ([[1978 in music|1978]])
* ''[[Because It's There (album)|Because It's There]]'' ([[1979 in music|1979]])
