      <text xml:space="preserve">The '''Eurovision Song Contest 1987''' was the 32nd [[Eurovision Song Contest]] and was held on [[May 9]], [[1987]] in [[Brussels]]. The presenter was [[Viktor Lazlo]].  [[Johnny Logan (singer)|Johnny Logan]] was the winner of this Eurovision with the song, [[Hold Me Now]]. 

