      <text xml:space="preserve">The '''Eurovision Song Contest 1985''' was the 30th [[Eurovision Song Contest]] and was held on [[May 4]], [[1985]] in [[Gothenburg]]. The presenter was [[Lill Lindfors]].  [[Bobbysocks]] was the winner of this Eurovision with the song [[La det swinge]]. 

