      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Coining''' can refer to:

#Production of money - see [[money]] or [[monetarism]].
#coining of new words or phrases - see [[neologism]]
#A machining process - see [[coining (machining)]]
#[[Counterfeiting]] of coins.

