      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Aunt Tenna''' by [[The Family Circus]] cartoonist [[Bil Keane]] was a themed weekday one-panel [[comic strip]] that generally ran on the television listings page of newspapers. Featuring an elderly woman with her hair done in the form of a TV [[Antenna (electronics)|antenna]], it had a short existence.

