        <ip>159.101.46.181</ip>
      </contributor>
      <comment>Link corrected</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">: ''Not to be confused with the [[United Kingdom|British]] explorer &quot;Captain&quot; [[James Cook]].

'''CapitanCook''' was a free, [[open content]] [[travel guide]]. The website was a [[Wiki|wikiwiki]], so everyone could create or edit articles, in order to share travel experiences and independent information. CapitanCook provided more than 1800 articles and photos on destinations around the world. All the articles and photos were published under the [[GNU Free Documentation License]].

On [[November 29]] [[2003]] CapitanCook merged with [[World66]].

