      <comment>links added (r-b.o, TG, &amp; TMM)</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Castle Ring''' is an [[Iron Age]] [[hill fort]] high up on the southern edge of [[Cannock Chase]], [[England]]. Apart from the perimeter earthworks, little remains visible. It is situated north of [[Burntwood]] and adjacent to the [[Heart of England Way]]. There are excellent views over [[Cannock Chase]], the [[Trent Valley]] and [[Staffordshire]].

{{UK-hist-stub}}

