      </contributor>
      <comment>+ table, + DANFS</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">{| border=&quot;1&quot; align=&quot;right&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; width=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:5px&quot;
|align=&quot;center&quot; colspan=&quot;2&quot;|[[Image:X-1.png|300px|X-1]]&lt;br&gt;&lt;!--Insert caption here (but only if needed; a plain picture of the ship doing nothing special needs no caption)--&gt;
|-
! style=&quot;color: white; height: 30px; background: navy;&quot;| Career
