| '''[[ATC code]]'''   &lt;br/&gt; [[ATC code N05|N05]]AH03
|-
| bgcolor=&quot;#eeeeee&quot; | [[Chemical formula]]
| bgcolor=&quot;#ddeeff&quot; | {{carbon}}&lt;sub&gt;17&lt;/sub&gt;{{hydrogen}}&lt;sub&gt;20&lt;/sub&gt;{{nitrogen}}&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;{{sulfur}}
|-
| bgcolor=&quot;#eeeeee&quot; | [[Molecular weight]]
| bgcolor=&quot;#ddeeff&quot; | 312.439
|-
| bgcolor=&quot;#eeeeee&quot; | [[Bioavailability]]
