* Duggan and others, &quot;[http://www.cochrane.org/cochrane/revabstr/AB001359.htm Olanzapine for schizophrenia (Cochrane Review)]&quot;, [[The Cochrane Library]], 2005.
* [http://www.zyprexa.com/ Zyprexa] - manufacturer's site
* [http://www.olanzapine.com/ Olanzapine.com] - promotional site
* [http://pi.lilly.com/us/zyprexa-pi.pdf Package Insert] (PDF)

{{Antipsychotics}}


