**[[Peter Schickele]] for ''[[P. D. Q. Bach|P.D.Q. Bach]]: Music for an Awful Lot of Winds &amp; Percussion''
*[[Grammy Awards of 1992]] 
**Peter Schickele for ''[[P. D. Q. Bach|P.D.Q. Bach]]: WTWP Classical Talkity-Talk Radio''
*[[Grammy Awards of 1991]] 
**Peter Schickele for ''[[P. D. Q. Bach|P.D.Q. Bach]]: Oedipus Tex and Other Choral Calamities''
*[[Grammy Awards of 1990]] 
**Peter Schickele for ''[[P. D. Q. Bach|P.D.Q. Bach]]: 1712 Overture and Other Musical Assaults''

